# Variant: [format: Cjs]

## Assets

### app.js

```js
// HIDDEN [\0rolldown/runtime.js]
let lib = require("lib");
require("polyfill");
lib = __toESM(lib);
// app.js
(globalThis.externalOrder ??= []).push("app");
globalThis.lib = lib.default;

```

